      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BIGBASHASH (5) went back last start and made a fleeting effort before the turn but failed to threaten when 4.5 metres away in fourth at this track over 1660m. That effort followed a win at this track two runs ago. Perfectly placed and is sure to play a major role. TIMMYTEO (7) is a strong fresh performer back after a spell of 11 weeks and is yet to taste defeat when resuming. Opened last prep with a strong win over 1660m at this track. Tactics will be crucial from this wide draw. Makes plenty of appeal in this most suitable assignment. ALL EYES ON BLING (2) is looming as a real threat after a better effort last start, finishing second at this track over 1660m when after leading early settled in behind the new leader and fought on well to the line.  MULLUM RUBY (10) is worth another chance after a last-start seventh over 1660m at this track a week ago. She has won all of her five career wins at this track.",
